    </Button>\n        ))}\n      </div>\n\n      <p className=\"text-center text-sm text-muted-foreground\">\n        or{\" \"}\n        <a\n          href=\"#\"\n          className=\"cursor-pointer font-medium text-foreground underline-offset-4 hover:underline\"\n        >\n          continue with email\n        </a>\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n",
